# BUYOLL — EXISTING APPLICATION IMPROVEMENT & FULL-STACK IMPLEMENTATION PROMPT

## Project objective

Improve and complete the **existing Buyoll e-commerce and group-contribution platform**. Do not rebuild the application from scratch, create a duplicate application, replace the existing brand, or remove working features.

Inspect the existing frontend, backend, database, authentication, routing, payment workflows, merchant dashboard, member dashboard, and GitHub repository before making changes. Implement the features below directly into the existing architecture, reusing working components and preserving existing data.

The objective is to deliver a fast, responsive, fully coordinated shopping platform where verified merchants sell products through configurable group-contribution systems, members contribute gradually, members can request small shopping loans, and customers receive product-specific AI assistance.

**Implementation rule:** Do not merely create attractive UI mockups. Every button, form, database operation, status update, payment workflow, dashboard, and permission must work correctly.

