**Members:** Manage their profiles, join groups, contribute, use eligible wallet balances, view their transactions, request loans, and participate in permitted rewards.

**Merchants:** Manage their own stores, products, images, configured groups, applicable promotions, product specifications, and authorized contribution-related information.

**Lenders:** Manage their registration, view eligible loan requests, access permitted group information, pay applicable fees, and initiate authorized loan disbursements.

**Administrators:** Manage platform configuration, merchant and lender verification, manual payment verification, fee approvals, loan approvals, disputes, financial oversight, and authorized moderation.

Enforce ownership checks and role permissions on every protected backend operation. Never trust a role, price, balance, fee, payment status, or product owner supplied only by the browser.

